```java
@Service // safe singleton: no shared mutable state
public class ReportService {
    public void run(Long userId) {
        generate(userId); // userId flows through parameters
    }

    private void generate(Long userId) { /* uses the parameter */ }
}
```
Because the data travels through parameters, one shared ReportService instance safely serves every concurrent request.

